   },
   {
    "name": "card",
    "description": "When the person describes work to delegate, look at the repo to choose scope globs, then call this with the task. It writes the card, runs the dry run and returns the brief; show the person the summary and dispatch when they say go (call dispatch, or call this with dispatch: true when they already said to go ahead). Never ask the person to edit a card file."
   },
   {
    "name": "init",
    "description": "Scaffold chassis-delegation in this repo: a card folder (agents/tasks/, or docs/cards/ in a plugin repo) with its README and a sample card, .chassis-delegation.json with its defaults, and .delegation/ in .gitignore. Never overwrites a file; says what it wrote."
   },
   {
    "name": "setup",
